"calendar day with the average from January 1 through the day before that "
"period: (period average / accumulated average - 1) x 100. Include days "
"without sales. Empty if the period starts January 1 or the comparison base "
"is not positive."
msgstr ""
"Desplaça el període seleccionat un any enrere. Compara la mitjana d’unitats "
"per dia natural amb la mitjana des de l’1 de gener fins al dia anterior al "
"període: (mitjana del període / mitjana acumulada - 1) x 100. Inclou els "
"dies sense vendes. Buit si comença l’1 de gener o la base no és positiva."

msgctxt ""
"help:sales.forecast.calculation.product_increase,selected_period_growth:"
msgid ""
"Shift the selected period back one year. Compare its average units per "
"calendar day with the average from January 1 through the day before that "
"period: (period average / accumulated average - 1) x 100. Include days "
"without sales. Empty if the period starts January 1 or the comparison base "
"is not positive."
msgstr ""
